  "interpretation": "The source caught DriverException and the original C++ root reported FINISHED. The worker independently classified the driver failure, exited 1, and retained the occupied hold. The other worker finished, reported settled lifecycle receipts, exited 0, and retained its own single-use hold. The authority preserved the failed read identity and disclosed no response.",
